Piper: the right components that would be optimal for this person. So it may choose a value

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:15.000
Piper: proposition for me that is focused on safety. Maybe it's data safety or data

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:19.000
Piper: privacy, or maybe it's safety and information and trustworthiness, and

