Piper: with the rest of the components.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:40.000
Piper: It could choose different tones,

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.000
Piper: different tones for the copy.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.000
Piper: For me, maybe I like dad jokes.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:46.000
Piper: For you, maybe you're more serious and formal.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:49.000
Piper: There's so many different component types

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:52.000
Piper: that you can templatize and an agent can plug and play

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:57.000
Piper: and truly make not necessarily stereotype assumptions that oh if you're a woman you must

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:02.000
Piper: care about families or if you're a man you must care about strength and you know it actually tries

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:06.000
Piper: to look at you as an individual and your past behavior how you've engaged in the app on the

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:13.000
Piper: website all the events but it also is trying to find clusters of similar users not by attribute

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:18.000
Piper: not by characteristics and oh all men like this all women like that all gen alpha's prefer this

