Piper: behavior. It's looking at people who tend to consume these types of, this type of articles in your app

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:35.000
Piper: or who look at these products or who read these blog posts or engage in sort of whatever app or

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:40.000
Piper: experience you may have. They tend to also resonate with messages around XYZ. So again,

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:45.000
Piper: agents are constantly drip feeding these push notifications, emails, SMS and just gauging.

