Piper: do you open them? Do you react? Do you look at them and then not behave in a certain way or behave

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:56.000
Piper: in a different way? And they just start to map out these customer journeys for each individual.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:15:01.000
Piper: And so it was truly a shock as a lifecycle marketer who I've just spent so many hours of my life

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:07.000
Piper: writing an individual email campaign that I spray and pray to my wonderful former subscriber list

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:11.000
Piper: you know 500,000 subscribers and we hope for the best and we look at attribution who clicks

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:18.000
Piper: who buys, and then it dies, that email campaign lives and dies, and with this AI decisioning

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:24.000
Piper: system it's quite different. Imagine that email goes on to live in perpetuity, but then an agent can

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:31.000
Piper: actually not generate the specific copy in the email, it's selecting approved, a whole list,

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:38.000
Piper: spreadsheets of approved messaging and copy to kind of design the perfect email experience, and

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:42.000
Piper: And the risks of that are so much lower than an AB test where you're sort of forcing an

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:45.000
Piper: entire journey on to everyone.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:49.000
Piper: That's one other thing I'll add is that like AB tests are so reductive to me now I would

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:53.000
Piper: you know we're beholden to the systems and tools that we have and there are many more

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:59.000
Piper: elementary email and SMS and push notification systems and an AB test is the best you can

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:03.000
Piper: get and if that's at your disposal use it but with this world of AI decisioning

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:08.000
Piper: you don't really need to AB test. Every single nudge, every single touch point is an AB test

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:15.000
Piper: that you are learning at a micro level. And that means that you don't have to write two variations

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:21.000
