00:53:08.000 --> 00:53:11.000
Piper: personalization, which is truly a buzzword. Every tool says that they can personalize

00:53:11.000 --> 00:53:13.000
Piper: It can mean everything and nothing.

00:53:13.000 --> 00:53:15.000
Piper: But I found an amazing company, AMP,

00:53:15.000 --> 00:53:16.000
Piper: or rather they found me.

00:53:16.000 --> 00:53:19.000
Piper: We met at a conference, commerce next in New York.

00:53:19.000 --> 00:53:23.000
