00:53:23.000 --> 00:53:25.000
Piper: I felt the future of my industry beheld.

00:53:25.000 --> 00:53:29.000
Piper: I saw AI agents, before agents were sort of a household

00:53:29.000 --> 00:53:32.000
Piper: concept and word and framing, that

00:53:32.000 --> 00:53:36.000
Piper: were basically running the entire customer engagement

00:53:36.000 --> 00:53:39.000
Piper: experience of any one user.

00:53:39.000 --> 00:53:43.000
Piper: So imagine you have an army of marketers and each marketer can be assigned to one of your

00:53:43.000 --> 00:53:48.000
Piper: customers or your users and they can study their behavior, their purchasing patterns,

