00:54:03.000 --> 00:54:06.000
Piper: of customer engagement, the future of CRM,

00:54:06.000 --> 00:54:07.000
Piper: and life cycle and retention,

00:54:07.000 --> 00:54:09.000
Piper: which is using AI decisioning,

00:54:09.000 --> 00:54:11.000
Piper: using an agentic decisioning tool

00:54:11.000 --> 00:54:13.000
Piper: to segment at a one-to-one level.

