Piper: use AI in their workflows,

00:55:15.000 --> 00:55:18.000
Piper: but again, AI's great generative tools to write copy,

00:55:18.000 --> 00:55:20.000
Piper: to build up imagery, to kind of map out strategy,

00:55:20.000 --> 00:55:23.000
Piper: but the decisioning process was happening by agents

00:55:23.000 --> 00:55:28.000
Piper: And that was quite a radical shift for most marketers, for most enterprise orgs that we

00:55:28.000 --> 00:55:29.000
Piper: were chatting with.

00:55:29.000 --> 00:55:33.000
Piper: And so I joined the AMP team wanting to just sink my teeth in and really understand what

00:55:33.000 --> 00:55:39.000
Piper: is the future of lifecycle and retention in marketing as a whole when agents can not

