00:57:48.000 --> 00:57:49.000
Piper: as sort of a default system build.

00:57:49.000 --> 00:57:51.000
Piper: I think we'll move away from this trigger

00:57:51.000 --> 00:57:54.000
Piper: and behavior-based automations towards that

00:57:54.000 --> 00:57:56.000
Piper: because it is ultimately better for the end user

00:57:56.000 --> 00:58:01.000
Piper: and also better for the marketers.

